      "post_id": "2088022849739247758",
      "url": "https://x.com/Shpigford/status/2088022849739247758",
      "text": "Looking for 5 more Shopify stores to give early access to the new Knockoff! 🛍️🚫🎉\n\nMost brands find out they’re being knocked off when a customer sends them a Temu link. Knockoff shows you how bad it actually is. And how to make it stop.\n\nConnect your Shopify store. Within the hour we’ve scanned Amazon, eBay, Walmart, and Temu for your stolen photos, copied descriptions, and misused trademarks. Then we keep watching around the clock.\n\nEvery hit comes with an evidence pack: screenshots, archived pages, side-by-sides, matched SKU. Plus a ready-to-submit takedown package built for that platform’s reporting process. You approve. You file. We track what happens.\n\nRemoved, relisted, or repeat offender. We track outcomes so enforcement compounds instead of resetting.\n\nIt goes beyond marketplace listings. Fake Shopify stores impersonating your brand? We catch them the moment their domain registers a certificate. Then walk them up the ladder: host, registrar, payment processor.\n\nBuyers are asking AI assistants what to buy. We monitor what ChatGPT recommends for your brand and alert you when a lookalike domain shows up in the answers.\n\nInterested? DM or email me: hello@knockoff.co",
      "original_text": "Looking for 5 more Shopify stores to give early access to the new Knockoff! 🛍️🚫🎉\n\nMost brands find out they’re being knocked off when a customer sends them a Temu link. Knockoff shows you how bad it actually is. And how to make it stop.\n\nConnect your Shopify store. Within the hour we’ve scanned Amazon, eBay, Walmart, and Temu for your stolen photos, copied descriptions, and misused trademarks. Then we keep watching around the clock.\n\nEvery hit comes with an evidence pack: screenshots, archived pages, side-by-sides, matched SKU. Plus a ready-to-submit takedown package built for that platform’s reporting process. You approve. You file. We track what happens.\n\nRemoved, relisted, or repeat offender. We track outcomes so enforcement compounds instead of resetting.\n\nIt goes beyond marketplace listings. Fake Shopify stores impersonating your brand? We catch them the moment their domain registers a certificate. Then walk them up the ladder: host, registrar, payment processor.\n\nBuyers are asking AI assistants what to buy. We monitor what ChatGPT recommends for your brand and alert you when a lookalike domain shows up in the answers.\n\nInterested? DM or email me: hello@knockoff.co",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "正在寻找另外 5 家 Shopify 店铺，提供新版 Knockoff 的早期访问权限！🛍️🚫🎉\n\n大多数品牌都是在客户给他们发来 Temu 链接时，才发现自己被仿冒了。Knockoff 会告诉你实际情况有多糟，以及如何让它停止。\n\n连接你的 Shopify 店铺。一个小时内，我们就会扫描 Amazon、eBay、Walmart 和 Temu，查找你被盗用的照片、被复制的描述和被滥用的商标。然后我们会全天候持续监控。\n\n每一个命中结果都会附带证据包：截图、归档页面、并排对比、匹配的 SKU。还包括一个可直接提交的下架材料包，按该平台的举报流程制作。你批准。你提交。我们跟踪后续进展。\n\n已下架、重新上架，或是屡犯者。我们会跟踪结果，让执法效果不断累积，而不是每次都从头开始。\n\n它不止覆盖市场平台上的商品列表。冒充你品牌的假 Shopify 店铺？它们的域名一注册证书，我们就会抓到。然后逐级处理：主机服务商、注册商、支付处理商。\n\n买家正在询问 AI 助手该买什么。我们会监控 ChatGPT 对你品牌的推荐，并在答案中出现相似域名时提醒你。\n\n感兴趣？私信或给我发邮件：hello@knockoff.co",
